{"id":"6912e28e7e9282d2","group":"58","path":"58/batch19/58-df-zfc-metric-product-metric.md","title":"ZFC Metric Product Metric","display":"df-zfc-metric-product-metric — ZFC Metric Product Metric","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-metric-product-metric","aliases":["58-df-zfc-metric-product-metric"],"display":"df-zfc-metric-product-metric — ZFC Metric Product Metric","depends_on":["[[58-df-metric]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-metric-product-metric"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-metric-product-metric</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-metric-product-metric — ZFC Metric Product Metric"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"267957a097ff75bf\" href=\"?note=267957a097ff75bf\" title=\"58-df-metric\">58-df-metric</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d,X,Y,d_X,d_Y\\in V\">\\(d,X,Y,d_X,d_Y\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Metric}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Metric}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"267957a097ff75bf\" href=\"?note=267957a097ff75bf\" title=\"58-df-metric\">58-df-metric</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcMetricProductMetric}_S:V^5\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcMetricProductMetric}_S:V^5\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}metric\\text{-}product\\text{-}metric}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{ZfcMetricProductMetric}_S(d,X,Y,d_X,d_Y)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Metric}_S(d_X,X)\\land\\mathrm{Metric}_S(d_Y,Y)\\\\\n&amp;\\land d\\in\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}^{(X\\times Y)\\times(X\\times Y)}\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall x,x&#39;\\in X\\;\\forall y,y&#39;\\in Y\\;\n\\bigl(d(\\langle\\langle x,y\\rangle,\\langle x&#39;,y&#39;\\rangle\\rangle)\n=d_X(\\langle x,x&#39;\\rangle)+d_Y(\\langle y,y&#39;\\rangle)\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}metric\\text{-}product\\text{-}metric}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{ZfcMetricProductMetric}_S(d,X,Y,d_X,d_Y)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Metric}_S(d_X,X)\\land\\mathrm{Metric}_S(d_Y,Y)\\\\\n&amp;\\land d\\in\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}^{(X\\times Y)\\times(X\\times Y)}\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall x,x&#39;\\in X\\;\\forall y,y&#39;\\in Y\\;\n\\bigl(d(\\langle\\langle x,y\\rangle,\\langle x&#39;,y&#39;\\rangle\\rangle)\n=d_X(\\langle x,x&#39;\\rangle)+d_Y(\\langle y,y&#39;\\rangle)\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>This defines the <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\ell^1\">\\(\\ell^1\\)</span> product metric and includes the metric hypotheses on both factors.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-metric","status":"resolved","id":"267957a097ff75bf","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-metric]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-metric","status":"resolved","id":"267957a097ff75bf","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Metric}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[58-df-metric]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"d,X,Y,d_X,d_Y\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Metric}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcMetricProductMetric}_S:V^5\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}metric\\text{-}product\\text{-}metric}\\vdash{}&\n\\mathrm{ZfcMetricProductMetric}_S(d,X,Y,d_X,d_Y)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Metric}_S(d_X,X)\\land\\mathrm{Metric}_S(d_Y,Y)\\\\\n&\\land d\\in\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}^{(X\\times Y)\\times(X\\times Y)}\\\\\n&\\land\\forall x,x'\\in X\\;\\forall y,y'\\in Y\\;\n\\bigl(d(\\langle\\langle x,y\\rangle,\\langle x',y'\\rangle\\rangle)\n=d_X(\\langle x,x'\\rangle)+d_Y(\\langle y,y'\\rangle)\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\ell^1","display":false}],"bytes":1062,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-2691","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch19/58-df-zfc-metric-product-metric.md|58-df-zfc-metric-product-metric]]（batch19）"}],"outgoing":["267957a097ff75bf"]}